I've come to see the Fashion Club that Erika keeps boasting about! {Changed this to an ! to represent her BELLOWING.}

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.480
G-Good afternoon...

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.680
Sure is a lively place you've got here!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:46.890
