00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.480
Aww, shucks.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.730
This year's Fashion Club members are really giving it their all!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:55.680
Well, I'm pretty knowledgeable about clothing design myself.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.750
We have to make our stage costumes over at the Drama Club, after all.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.820
Well, as you can see, we're on a whole other level from your club's costume designs.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.910
We're pretty serious when it comes to fashion, after all.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.020
Now wait just a second!

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.920
We put our all into making those costumes too, ya know!

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:16.120
Well, we're pros when it comes to all things fashion.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:19.420
Your Drama Club might be pros at theatrics, but clothes are out of your league!

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.900
What're you talking about?

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.140
When it comes to costumes, the Drama Club are the specialists!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:27.560
Whether it's costumes or not doesn't matter! When it comes to fashion, <i>we're</i> the experts!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.140
N-Now now, you two...

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:33.600
Well, if you're that confident, why
 don't <i>you</i> try making our costumes?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:38.150
Fine! I'll show you just how cool a costume can look!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.410
You mean that, Erika?

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:41.920
Every word.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.580
<i>Wh-What's with these two?</i>

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.110
<i>Just what on earth is going on here?</i>

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:03.050
Erika is Her Rival<i>!</i>

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:03.050
Erika is Her Rival<i>!</i>

