Beating

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:04.340
Azusa!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.800
Beating

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.800
Azusa!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:09.130
Now, what this means for us is we of the Fashion Club are going to make

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.730
a seriously awesome costume for the theatrical competition next month!

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:17.040
We've accepted her challenge, so let's rub Azusa's nose right in it!

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.070
She's really steaming...

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:25.790
And if we make it right, the entire school will recognize the Fashion Club's talent,

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.330
and our popularity will shoot through the roof!{Really tempted to use 'and we'll become the coolest kids in school!' but I figure despite this ep being an excuse to ham it the fuck up, that's a step too far.} {Yeah, you're right. But here's a suggestion: skyrocket -> 'shoot through the roof'? Or is that too long?}

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.040
Am I right?!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.000
Y-Yeah...

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:34.910
All right then, everyone! Follow my lead!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.920
O-Okay!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:41.760
This dress of mine is—

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.510
Stop, stop!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.240
A refined lady would have a far more elegant laugh than that!

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.850
How many times do I have to tell you this stuff?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.390
Sh-She does seem kinda forceful, doesn't she?

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.550
She is rather strict...

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.940
Well, Azusa's aiming to become a professional actress,

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.190
so she takes even her practices really seriously.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.450
That's really pretty!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.110
Yeah, that does look pretty good!

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.450
Doesn't it?!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.450
That's no good at all!

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:11.110
This doesn't befit a noblewoman at all!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.270
Don't you understand that?

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.330
U-Um...

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.330
All right then!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:22.430
In that case, the ever-reliable Fashion Club will just have to make you your costume!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.220
You just watch, Azusa!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.880
Sure. I look forward to it.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:36.620
Must be nice having parents who run a clothes shop.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:40.430
It really must! There are so many pretty clothes here.

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:44.130
Well, having so many clothes to study helps improve my fashion sense.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.770
So by choosing the upper and lower halves of the design...

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:53.370
You see? We have a basis for our design pattern.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.560
Wow!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.660
But we're making an outfit for a
 high-class lady, so how about this?

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.130
Oh, that could work!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:01.250
Though what about this design here?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.420
No, I really think this one is better.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:08.990
But you have to consider it's Azusa playing that lady. I think this would suit her more.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.350
Well, what do you all think?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.320
I dunno...

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.480
I like the coloring on Erika's more.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.100
Tsubomi.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.620
U-Uh, yes?

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.220
Which do you prefer, Tsubomi?

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:22.650
M-Me?

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.780
Well...

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:30.950
With Azusa's stature, I think the design Toshiko suggested would work best.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.490
I think you might be right!

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.960
You've got a good eye, Tokko!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:42.000
Well, I've got enough confidence that my fashion sense won't lose to yours, Erika! {Changed it around to make it a bit more English-comprehensible. Old: "I've confidence enough that"}

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.030
Well, you'll have to excuse my insolence, then!

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:47.380
All right then!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.590
Let's all make this costume extra special awesome! {Super special awesome}

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:51.890
Right!

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:57.520
The strider's shaded scarlet, a-i-u-e-o!

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.880
The strider's shaded scarlet, a-i-u-e-o!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.880
You're being too quiet!

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:01.770
Speak from the diaphragm!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:05.110
The strider's shaded scarlet, a-i-u-e-o!

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:05.110
You're not being loud enough!

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.690
We won't win the competition like this!

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:08.650
Huh?!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.860
You mean we're the only ones who came to the ball?!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:12.740
Indeed.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.270
This is the letter he left behind.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.160
That's so cruel.

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:22.170
Yet again I am cast aside in favor of the allure of the city.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.040
That's no good at all!

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.970
You should be shouting that line in a loud voice, right?

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:30.680
But if you're truly saddened by something, you're hardly going to be shouting!

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.590
Don't "but" me! Just do as I say!

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:37.260
You should be shouting that line. Understand?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.200
We really don't have time to waste arguing about this.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:44.340
Don't you all want to win the competition?

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.400
We haven't got that long left before the tournament phase starts.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:49.360
While we're wasting time with this, all the other schools will be making progress—

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.440
Just shut up already!

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.830
You're always going on about that damn competition!

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:55.620
This club isn't

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.490
even fun anymore!

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:03.420
All we're doing is following your grand vision to the letter, Azusa!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.840
You never listen to what we have to say at all!

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:08.150
She's right.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:10.800
I don't want to follow a leader like you anymore.

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:12.890
Let's go, everyone.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.340
Wait!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:23.990
I am so beautiful.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.230
Non, non! The light is off-center!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:35.730
The whole world shall bow before my beauty!

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.500
Yay!

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:38.410
Perfect!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.820
Now my next performance can be even more fabulous. {Can we make this 'fabulous' as a homage to doremi?}

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.900
Just wait for me, Precure.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.820
Lights!

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:09.310
Come on, come on, come on!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.880
Erika, about this embroidering...

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.150
Oh, this bit?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.400
Something like this, I guess?

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:17.920
That looks difficult...

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:20.370
I know you two can do it!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:23.820
Erika! You want the lace a little higher up?

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.870
Yeah, I'll take a look in a sec!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.960
The strider's shaded scarlet, a-i-u-e-o!

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.300
President Erika!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.890
Is this all right?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:42.240
Oh, that's perfect! Just as I 
expected from you, Naminami!

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.350
I know, right?

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:46.300
Shrimps swim swiftly through seaweed.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.030
What do you think?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.340
Nice idea!{English.}

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:53.940
I thought so!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.780
The plantation produces persimmon...

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.780
Wow, it really is!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.070
Isn't it?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.620
The woodpecker whiles...

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:12.750
There she is!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.400
The costume's pretty much done, so gather everyone up and come take a look!

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.980
Where's everyone else?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.180
They're... not here yet, it seems.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.000
Oh, really?

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.540
Well, I think the costume's turned out pretty well!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:27.510
We've all worked really hard on it together! {She doesn't actually say 'together'. But if I can make it sound like Azusa's getting her ugly nose rubbed in it a little harder, I'll damn well do it.}

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:28.270
I'm sorry...

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.860
I'll come look at it later, all right?

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:36.490
Oh!

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.530
Aren't they the Drama Club members?

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:40.360
Tsubomi?!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.870
Excuse me!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.200
You're from the Drama Club, right?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.410
Yeah, and?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.450
Aren't you going to practice?

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.860
Azusa's been waiting for you on the rooftop.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.330
We've...

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.120
decided to quit the Drama Club.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.100
Huh?

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.880
Whaaaat?!

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:20.180
Erika, does this look good?

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.110
Erika?

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.130
Yeah, that's okay.{She says 'okay' in English, lol.}

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:27.180
Phew, that's a relief.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.750
The thing is, with Azusa...

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:40.260
She loves theater with all her heart, but she loves it so much she loses sight of the people around her.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:46.380
Yet I can't bring myself to hate her for being so driven.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:49.610
Because she kinda reminds me of myself.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.580
Hey, Tsubomi...

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:54.020
Yes?

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:59.110
Do you think everyone enjoys being in the Fashion Club?

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:03.030
Erika, just look around you.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.140
See? Everyone's having tons of fun!

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:09.620
Everyone's excited enough to match your frantic pace! {Enthused -> excited}

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.070
Jeez, Tsubomi!

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.040
Thank you!

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:16.320
Erika, we're finished over here!

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:17.500
And here!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.050
And we've just wrapped things up too!

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.970
Whoa, this is totally amazing!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.180
This club isn't even fun anymore!

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.100
I...

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:31.430
Huh?

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.270
Azusa! You came after all!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.940
Come inside! We've finished your costume!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.730
Sorry. I'll come some other time.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:48.370
Everyone has left this town behind.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:50.370
And now I...

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:59.000
I stand alone.

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:04.070
Why have you all abandoned me?

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.050
Hrm?

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:10.220
The Flower of your Heart has weakened quite considerably, hasn't it?

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.020
Je suis si beau.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.610
Who are you?!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.900
Moi?

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.450
I am the star of the desert plane, Kobraja!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:31.100
Flower of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.900
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.260
Lights!

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:51.310
That voice just now...

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.090
It's a Desertrian!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.270
Azusa?!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.150
Let's go, Erika!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.150
Right!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:14.010
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.190
Precure!

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.790
Open My Heart!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:07.580
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.830
Cure Blossom!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.190
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:22.950
Cure Marine!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.250
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.990
Liiiiiiiiighhhhhts!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.250
Ah, my extras have finally arrived.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.750
Well, make sure your performance doesn't show me up.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:54.640
I gave my all to help make the Drama Club what it is!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.020
Marine!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:07.520
I just wanted them to understand the joy of losing yourself in acting!

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:12.660
But why do you all abandon me like this?!

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.070
That's... our leader?

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.140
Hmph!

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:18.290
You humans are just so isolated at heart.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:22.620
Working together to accomplish one single task is just a waste of effort. {wtf lipstick snackies}

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.960
It's not a waste!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:29.440
Being able to make things happen with your friends is what makes them fun.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:33.300
And there are things you'll never accomplish without them!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.640
And they're a waste of effort too. {wastes -> a waste. The original really looked weird.}

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.350
I just want everyone...

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.890
to act with me!

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:43.850
Leader!

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:48.980
I'm sure the strength of Azusa's determination will reach them!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:49.900
Marine!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.540
We have to do something about that beam!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.980
Oh my. Are you just going to keep running, Precures?

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:07.210
It seems the star isn't going to need to take center stage.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.510
I won't let you fire it!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.480
Liiiiiiights?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:28.740
Marine!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:29.400
Right!

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:33.950
You're just toying with Azusa's theater-loving heart.

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:39.570
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!{WHERE IS YOUR FUNNY FACE NOW}

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.840
Gather, Floral Power!

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.010
Marine Tact!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.330
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:13.030
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.700
Next time, I shall take my leading role! Adieu!

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:42.720
Azusa... Azusa!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.930
Have I been sleeping all this time?

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:51.850
Azusa!

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.960
Here! Your costume!

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.860
We all worked really hard to make it for you!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.680
You all seemed to be having so much fun in the Fashion Club.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.990
I kept pressing on, no matter what,

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:13.950
but I never stopped to think 
about how everyone else felt.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.090
It's all right.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.320
It's not too late to change, you know?

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:22.840
Why not try telling them how you really feel?

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:25.830
Erika...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.400
Everyone has left this town behind.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:35.870
And now I...

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.950
I stand alone.{These three lines are a copy-paste from earlier, so if you change them, remember to change these to match too. :w}

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:49.250
I really am all alone. {WHAT THE FUCK IS WRONG WITH HER FACE}

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:51.870
No!

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:55.380
You are not alone!

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.650
You guys...

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:01.720
I'm so sorry!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:08.820
I tried to make this play perfect all by 
myself without considering your opinions.

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:15.220
That doesn't change the fact that we love acting too.

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:18.320
That's why we want to return to the Drama Club.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.900
Though we'll be making sure you listen to us in future.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.120
I want us to work together again!

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:28.360
Is that all right?

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:30.220
Yeah...

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.550
Yeah!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.500
Hey! Don't cry, Leader!

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:42.990
In the language of flowers, a
 bougainvillea means "passion."

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:48.740
Now that she has her friends at her side again, 
Azusa's love for acting will bloom once more, won't it?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.520
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:09.330
With this, the Great Heart Tree will recover a little more!

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:13.760
I'm so nervous!

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:20.270
Whoa...

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.170
Now!

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.720
Let us begin the ball!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.430
She looks so pretty...

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:33.100
I can't believe it...

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.280
That's the costume we made...

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:38.260
Yeah! It looks really, really beautiful!

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:41.780
Tsubomi?

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:45.450
Designing clothes really is so much fun, isn't it?

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:46.860
It sure is!

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:50.480
I want to keep designing them!

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:52.540
Forever and ever! {literally just 'more and more' but sounds dumb imo? Also, ZUTTOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO}

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:09.920
{ED}

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.770
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.690
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.610
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.570
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.120
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.090
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.250
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.710
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.680
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:53.680
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.520
is about to begin!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.730
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.650
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.570
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.110
We're pretty

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.910
at full bloom!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.030
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.080
until it shines

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.620
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.870
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.880
So don't sulk

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.800
because a smile's the best!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:30.260
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.470
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.350
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>Cure Moonlight is so strong and elegant!</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:48.650
<i>But if we want to become stronger, what is it we need?</i>

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:51.200
<i>What you lack is her beautiful spirit!</i>

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:54.570
<i>Don't try to mimic her actions, but rather inherit her pure heart!</i>

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:56.410
<i>Please, Yuri!</i>

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:00.500
<i>Teach us how we can become stronger Precure!</i>

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.870
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:06.540
Please Recognize

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:06.540
Please Recognize

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:08.790
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
